        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "This is an excellent course. Very hands-on and you get to drive and practice on ice for a full 3-4 hours. Highly recommended for anyone, especially those who commutes on winter highways.",
        "time": 1520126485,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "JDM Depots",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101304014610311685013/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWQXAWQGGTTVEXw_aaSiSUZd6syeVqFQtOk9K9zyeYr8EONoE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent coach for anyone who wants to enjoy and learn at the same time. I could easily state that Claude is the reference for anyone who wants to have a positive start.",
        "time": 1498149891,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julien Fayolle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104501047230114282645/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXfAbQ_ai_TLlbKmpMUxFQTXpg3zVwO551cTfw1Ti1LimeTjzk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "A truly wonderful, unique experience!\nMr. Bourdonnais is a very generous man who loves to share his passion.\nHe's an excellent instructor!\n\nYou won't be disappointed, either by the experience or by Mr. Bourdonnais!",
        "time": 1519649756,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Frédéric Sancho",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117954988356096823938/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKdbnOdzG_d-fgJeWuKoATuR78XKWyW0ND63iCgqOwE61hMqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent half-day ice driving course. Claude Bourbonnais is a fantastic coach who takes the time to explain everything thoroughly. The exercises are varied, and there's plenty of time to practice. This course should be mandatory!",
        "time": 1519586580,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Souad Bougares",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116118588528258476977/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJbZvJuLm8T4zn3kR-V-Tsn9eOdg7tgHw5NKrV63u6EGrEEIw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "An extraordinary experience!\n\nMr. Bourbonnais stands out for his professionalism and his great passion for his work. The course is very comprehensive with plenty of hands-on practice. Fun is guaranteed too! An experience not to be missed; I highly recommend it.",
        "time": 1674867967,
